#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Yordam"

#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "This will be the main content of your new site content.  The summary can be used to display a brief concise description of your content.  Further, the summary  will be displayed in list and card views of your record on the website.  Alternatively, the first few sentence from the main content will be used."
msgstr "Bu sizning yangi sayt kontentingizning asosiy mazmuni bo'ladi. Xulosa sizning kontentingizning qisqacha tavsifini ko'rsatish uchun ishlatilishi mumkin. Bundan tashqari, xulosa veb-saytdagi yozuvingizning ro'yxat va karta ko'rinishlarida ko'rsatiladi. Shu bilan bir qatorda, asosiy mazmundan birinchi bir necha jumla ishlatiladi."

#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "Images"
msgstr "Rasmlar"

#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "The <b>first image</b> in order of left to right here, <b>will be the main image</b> of your record displayed on the page and in thumbnails in list and card views.  All another images will be displayed below the main content."
msgstr "Bu yerdagi chapdan o'ngga tartibdagi <b>birinchi rasm</b>, sahifada va ro'yxat hamda karta ko'rinishlaridagi eskizlarda ko'rsatiladigan yozuvingizning <b>asosiy rasmi bo'ladi</b>. Boshqa barcha rasmlar asosiy kontent ostida ko'rsatiladi."

#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "Heroes"
msgstr "Qahramonlar"

#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "Any page/content type can have multiple <b>hero banners</b>.  If there is more then one they will be rotated on an hourly basis."
msgstr "Har qanday sahifa/kontent turi bir nechta <b>qahramon bannerlariga</b> ega bo'lishi mumkin. Agar birdan ortiq bo'lsa, ular har soatda almashtiriladi."

